request: Add a button that clears every movie whose `seen` flag is true from the watchlist.

governor turn 1: plan -> watchlist-store, watchlist  (The request's "seen" flag maps to the existing `watched` boolean on WatchItem (the only watched/seen flag in the model). Plan: watchlist-store gains clearWatched() which removes every watched item, preserves unwatched order and persists like the other mutators; the watchlist page gets a page-level "Clear watched" button (disabled when nothing is watched) that calls it and announces how many movies were cleared.)
round 1: owners watchlist-store=ok watchlist=ok; oracle RED
